#. L_CAVE_014
msgid "Picked up a suitcase.\n"
msgstr "アタッシュケースを手に入れた\n"

#. L_CAVE_015
msgid "Obtain air stewardess uniform.\n"
msgstr "Obtain air stewardess uniform.\n"

#. L_CAVE_016
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_CAVE_017
msgid "Disguise\n"
msgstr "ユニフォーム\n"

#. L_CAVE_018
msgid "Disguise\n"
msgstr "ユニフォーム\n"

#. L_CAVE_019
msgid "Picked up a stewardess uniform.\n"
msgstr "スチュワーデスのユニフォームを手に入れた\n"

#. L_CAVE_020
msgid "Obtain flight plans from safe.\n"
msgstr "Obtain flight plans from safe.\n"

#. L_CAVE_021
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_CAVE_022
msgid "Flight Plans\n"
msgstr "フライトプラン\n"

#. L_CAVE_023
msgid "Flight Plans\n"
msgstr "フライトプラン\n"

#. L_CAVE_024
msgid "Picked up the flight plans.\n"
msgstr "フライトプランを手に入れた\n"

#. L_CAVE_025
msgid "Look out - it's an intruder...\n"
msgstr "キャー！　侵入者よ！\n"

#. L_CAVE_026
msgid "Innocent civilians have been killed.\n"
msgstr "民間人が倒された\n"

#. L_CAVE_027
msgid "Is he OK?\n"
msgstr "彼は大丈夫？\n"

#. L_CAVE_028
msgid "I'll go and get some help.\n"
msgstr "助けを呼んでくる\n"

#. L_CAVE_029
msgid "Good afternoon.\n"
msgstr "こんにちは。\n"

#. L_CAVE_030
msgid "OK, you know the way from here.\n"
msgstr "飛行機への行き方はご存知ね。\n"

#. L_CAVE_031
msgid "You'll have to check that weapon in here.\n"
msgstr "その武器はここで外して下さい。\n"

#. L_CAVE_032
msgid "Oh, my God!\n"
msgstr "何てこと！！！\n"

#. L_CAVE_033
msgid "Weapons are not allowed in the base.\n"
msgstr "武器などの持ちこみは禁止されています！\n"

#. L_CAVE_034
msgid "Right, I'm calling security.\n"
msgstr "ＯＫ、警備兵を呼ぶわ\n"

#. L_CAVE_035
msgid "System shutdown initiated...\n"
msgstr "システムのシャットダウン開始\n"

#. L_CAVE_036
msgid "Security systems have been shut down.\n"
msgstr "手荷物検査システムがシャットダウンされた\n"

#. L_CAVE_037
msgid "Weapons have been detected.\n"
msgstr "武器が探知された\n"

#. L_CAVE_038
msgid "Suitcase has been deposited.\n"
msgstr "アタッシュケースを預けた\n"

#. L_CAVE_039
msgid "Suitcase has been scanned.\n"
msgstr "アタッシュケースの装備品が探知された\n"

#. L_CAVE_040
msgid "Hey, you - this is a restricted area.\n"
msgstr "おい、こら。ここは関係者以外立ち入り禁止だぞ！\n"

#. L_CAVE_041
msgid "Are you new around here?\n"
msgstr "なんだ？　オマエ新人か？\n"

#. L_CAVE_042
msgid "Hey - give me back my case.\n"
msgstr "おい、それはオレのアタッシュケースだぞ。\n"

#. L_CAVE_043
msgid "You get security - I'll deal with her...\n"
msgstr "お前は警備兵を呼んでくれ、オレがこいつの相手をする…\n"

#. L_CAVE_044
msgid "Upstairs...there's an intruder.\n"
msgstr "こちら２階だ。侵入者を発見した…\n"

#. L_CAVE_045
msgid "Laser grid access denied.\n"
msgstr "レーザーグリッドシステムへのアクセスが拒否された\n"

#. L_CAVE_046
msgid "Laser grid system has been overloaded.\n"
msgstr "レーザーグリッドシステムがオーバーロードした\n"

#. L_CAVE_047
msgid "Too many neutral casualties inflicted.\n"
msgstr "中立の人たちが多くギセイになった\n"

#. L_CAVE_048
msgid "Stop them from getting the safe...\n"
msgstr "あいつらから金庫を守ってくれ…\n"

#. L_CAVE_049
msgid "Disguise worn.\n"
msgstr "ユニフォームで変装した\n"

#. L_CAVE_050
msgid ""
"Now's your chance! Grab the stewardess's \n"
"bag and get her uniform.\n"
msgstr ""
"チャンスだ！　スチュワーデスのバッグを\n"
"奪って、ユニフォームを入手するのだ。\n"

#. L_CAVE_051
msgid "Use that case to conceal your equipment.\n"
msgstr "そのケースを使って君の装備品を積み込むのだ\n"

#. L_CAVE_052
msgid "The case will get stopped unless you do something.\n"
msgstr "このアタッシュケースは、このままでは止められてしまうぞ\n"

#. L_CAVE_053
msgid ""
"So that's Air Force One? ... Huh, smaller \n"
"than I thought.\n"
msgstr ""
"あれが大統領専用のエアフォースワン？\n"
"思ったより小さいのね。\n"

#. L_CAVE_054
msgid "Stop them - they're breaking into the safe...\n"
msgstr "アイツらを止めてくれ！　きっと金庫を狙ってるんだ…\n"

#. L_CAVE_055
msgid ""
"Agent Dark in position. I can see the main entrance to the base, and I can "
"just make out the cable car arrival point.\n"
msgstr ""
"エージェント・ダーク、スタンバイＯＫ。\n"
"基地の入口、ケーブルカー到着地点を確認。\n"

#. L_CAVE_056
msgid ""
"Excellent, Joanna. That cable car is your way in... Our observer at the "
"lower terminus has spotted a member of the flight crew boarding a minute "
"ago. She is being escorted by air base troops. I don't have to remind you "
"that...\n"
msgstr ""
"いいぞ、ジョアンナ。ケーブルカーは\n"
"今そっちに向かっている。\n"
"pスチュワーデスが乗ったのを\n"
"我々のスパイが確認した。\n"
"p空軍基地の連中も一緒だ。\n"
"くどいようだが…\n"

#. L_CAVE_057
msgid ""
"That they're probably innocent of any involvement in Trent's little scheme. "
"And I can't shoot them even if they shoot at me. What about the NSA "
"Agents?\n"
msgstr ""
"基地の人間は、無関係なので\n"
"撃っちゃダメなんでしょ。\n"
"pところで、国防省のヤツらはどうなの？\n"

#. L_CAVE_058
msgid ""
"I don't know how far the conspiracy has spread through the NSA, but I'm "
"willing to bet that the men Trent has around him here are loyal to him and "
"his plan. You have to get the evidence of Trent's betrayal onto Air Force "
"One and show it to the President.\n"
msgstr ""
"トレントがどの程度の人間にまで\n"
"計画を伝えているのかは不明だ。\n"
"pだが、トレントの近くにいる連中は\n"
"彼の計画に加わっているはずだ。\n"
"p専用機に乗り、例の証拠ビデオを\n"
"大統領に見せるのだ。\n"

#. L_CAVE_059
msgid ""
"Yes, and protect him from his abductors. Do you have any idea what Trent's "
"plan might be yet, and what about those blonde guys?\n"
msgstr ""
"そして、大統領を守れってことね。\n"
"トレントの計画は何か、わかった？\n"
"pあと、あのミーティングに居た\n"
"ブロンドヘアーの男は何者？\n"

#. L_CAVE_060
msgid ""
"Only vague suspicions, and I won't distract you with those. Good luck. "
"Carrington out.\n"
msgstr ""
"まだ推測の段階なので、言うのは\n"
"やめておこう。グッドラック。\n"

#. L_CAVE_061
msgid "Lift inoperative - security system is active.\n"
msgstr "エレベーター停止　警備システム作動中\n"

#. L_CAVE_062
msgid "Critical mission personnel disabled.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な人物が倒された\n"

#. L_CAVE_063
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. L_CAVE_064
msgid "Entrance to base secured.\n"
msgstr "基地への進入完了\n"

#. L_CAVE_065
msgid "We're taking over!!\n"
msgstr "ハイジャックがいるぞ！\n"

#. L_CAVE_066
msgid "Hover trolley has been shut down.\n"
msgstr "手荷物積み込み用のコンベアが停止した\n"

#. L_CAVE_067
msgid "Equipment cannot be checked in.\n"
msgstr "装備品の積み込みができません\n"
